msgid ""
"Built on the Chromium Embedded Framework. Karere 4.0 replaces the WebKitGTK "
"backend with the Chromium Embedded Framework, bringing full video attachment "
"playback (H.264/AAC), multi-account support with isolated sessions, per-"
"account zoom, and a faster, more compatible rendering engine while keeping "
"the same native GTK4/libadwaita shell."
msgstr ""
"Ngayon ay binuo sa CEF/Chromium 148. Pinapalitan ng Karere 4.0 ang WebKitGTK "
"backend ng Chromium Embedded Framework, na nagdadala ng buong playback ng "
"video attachment (H.264/AAC), suporta sa multi-account na may nakahiwalay na "
"mga session, per-account na zoom, at mas mabilis, mas tugmang rendering "
"engine habang pinapanatili ang parehong native na GTK4/libadwaita shell."

